From: game port contributors <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Limit game save header to pinned NitroDWC account types on 3DS

The Battle Frontier save-state structure includes wifi_list.h solely for
DWCUserData/DWCFriendData declarations. Including all of dwc.h also
pulls in the GameSpy transport headers, which are not yet portable
(and whose Nintendo extras.h is absent from the pinned NitroDWC tree).

Use the authentic account-data type header under SDK_PORT_3DS, without
creating replacement types, network stubs or changing the DS build.

diff --git a/include/wifi_list.h b/include/wifi_list.h
--- a/include/wifi_list.h
+++ b/include/wifi_list.h
@@ -1,7 +1,13 @@
 #ifndef POKEPLATINUM_WIFI_LIST_H
 #define POKEPLATINUM_WIFI_LIST_H
 
+#ifdef SDK_PORT_3DS
+// Save interfaces only need NitroDWC's real persistent account types.
+// GameSpy transport/runtime integration is deliberately separate.
+#include <base/dwc_account.h>
+#else
 #include <dwc.h>
+#endif
 
 #include "struct_decls/wi_fi_list.h"
 
